.Dd May 30, 2026
.Dt ZSVC 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm zsvc
.Nd unified service control for zdots-managed services
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm list
.Nm
.Cm status
.Ar service
.Nm
.Cm diag
.Ar service
.Nm
.Cm health
.Op Fl -json
.Op Ar service | all
.Nm
.Cm map
.Op Fl -json
.Op Ar service
.Nm
.Cm logs
.Cm all
.Op Fl -json | Fl -paths
.Op Fl n Ar lines
.Op Fl -no-follow
.Nm
.Cm start | stop | restart | wait | reload | logs | validate
.Ar service
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the per-service control surface for the zdots platform. It exposes one
registry for the services that make up the local control plane and delegates
actions to each service's authoritative manager.
.Pp
Use
.Xr zdots-ctl 8
for whole-platform lifecycle. Use
.Nm
when one component needs inspection, restart, logs, or validation.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "validate service"
.It Cm list
Print every registered service with state, pid, and endpoint.
.It Cm start Ar service
Start one service.
.It Cm stop Ar service
Stop one service.
.It Cm restart Ar service
Restart one service.
.It Cm wait Ar service Op Fl -timeout Ar seconds
Block until the service is healthy \(em the same probe
.Cm health
uses \(em or exit non-zero after
.Ar seconds
(default 30). Composes after
.Cm start Ns / Ns Cm restart
in scripts.
.It Cm reload Ar service
Gracefully reload one service when supported. Currently used for nginx.
.It Cm status Ar service
Print service-specific status and liveness.
.It Cm health Op Fl -json Op Ar service | all
Probe service liveness. With no service, prints every registered service plus
the local nginx-fronted URLs. With
.Fl -json ,
emits a machine-readable document for AI tools and automation.
.It Cm map Op Fl -json Op Ar service
The discovery card for one or every service: purpose, API kind, auth
requirement, health-check path, a runnable example call, prerequisite
services, and a docs pointer. This is the "you are here" surface for an
external, non-zdots tool or AI deciding what to call and in what order \(em
.Cm health
and
.Cm list
answer where a service is;
.Cm map
answers what it is for and how to use it. With
.Fl -json ,
each entry also carries a
.Qq depends_on
array (e.g.
.Cm o2
depends on
.Cm otel ;
.Cm ctx
depends on
.Cm postgres )
so a caller can resolve prerequisites before adopting a service. Pairs with
.Xr agent-guide 1
for the full platform command index beyond just services.
.It Cm logs Ar service
Tail the service log.
.It Cm logs Cm all Op Fl -json | Fl -paths Op Fl n Ar lines Op Fl -no-follow
Tail every registered service log from one terminal. Use
.Fl -no-follow
for a one-shot snapshot, or
.Fl -paths
to print the log source table without tailing. With
.Fl -json ,
emits the log source inventory for AI tools and automation.
.It Cm diag Ar service
Print status, health, launchd state, recent logs, and suggested next commands.
.It Cm validate Ar service
Validate service config when the underlying manager supports it.
.El
.Sh SERVICES
.Bl -tag -width "postgres"
.It Cm llama
AI inference server, port 11500. Aliases:
.Cm ai ,
.Cm server .
.It Cm embed
Embedding server, port 11501. Alias:
.Cm llama-embed .
.It Cm otel
OpenTelemetry collector, port 4318. Aliases:
.Cm telemetry ,
.Cm collector .
.It Cm colima
Docker runtime VM. Aliases:
.Cm vm ,
.Cm docker .
.It Cm nginx
TLS reverse proxy on ports 80 and 443. Aliases:
.Cm web ,
.Cm proxy .
.It Cm postgres
PostgreSQL 18 backing the
.Cm my
database. Aliases:
.Cm pg ,
.Cm db ,
.Cm database .
.It Cm redis
Analytics cache on port 6379. Aliases:
.Cm cache ,
.Cm kv .
.El
.Sh LIFECYCLE MODEL
.Nm
separates registration from health. A LaunchAgent can be registered and running
while its HTTP, database, or cache health probe fails. Use
.Cm diag
to isolate that state before restarting.
.Pp
The live branch-readiness check is:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
zdots-ctl status
zsvc list
bats tests/platform_e2e.bats
.Ed
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.local/state/zsh/otel-collector.log"
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/llama-server.log
llama-server log.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/llama-embed.log
embedding server log.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/otel-collector.log
OTel collector log.
.It Pa /opt/homebrew/var/log/nginx/error.log
nginx error log.
.It Pa /opt/homebrew/var/log/postgresql@18.log
Postgres log.
.It Pa /opt/homebrew/var/log/redis.log
Redis log.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.zdots.llama-server.plist
llama-server LaunchAgent.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.zdots.llama-embed.plist
embedding server LaunchAgent.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/homebrew.mxcl.postgresql@18.plist
Postgres LaunchAgent.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/homebrew.mxcl.redis.plist
Redis LaunchAgent.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
zsvc list
zsvc status postgres
zsvc health
zsvc logs all -n 100
zsvc logs all --paths
zsvc diag llama
zsvc restart redis
zsvc reload nginx
zsvc map
zsvc map llama --json
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-ctl 8 ,
